    "Existing Table and Card variant IDs remain unchanged.",
    "Avatar sizes map to existing control/spacing roles; colors use the existing primary light badge palette.",
    "DetailList rows are unchanged; grid responds to its container (three to two at 600 px, one at 400 px).",
    "The application specimens own detached Card header/metadata text frames because Penpot nested component overrides do not reliably render. Avatar, Tabs, Buttons, and EmptyState remain linked.",
